Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.55,0:00:01.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}What if a few lines of code
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.98,0:00:04.53,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}became the start of a new passion?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.55,0:00:12.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}With L9ITHA.Club, students discover\NPython programming
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.33,0:00:15.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}in a structured computer club,\Nwith step-by-step activities
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.18,0:00:17.26,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}and the support of their teacher.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.45,0:00:20.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Two tracks, Junior and Pro,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.41,0:00:23.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}offer a progression suited to each age.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.30,0:00:26.17,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}We warm up, practise with guidance,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.19,0:00:28.53,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}practise on our own, then take on a challenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.45,0:00:34.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Students write their code, run it\Nand watch the result.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.30,0:00:38.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Hints and messages in French\Nhelp them understand their mistakes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.61,0:00:41.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}They fix it, try again and move forward.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.50,0:00:45.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Their work is saved\Nfor the next session.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.45,0:00:51.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}For parents, it's a supervised activity
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.21,0:00:54.54,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}to build logical thinking,\Nencourage creativity
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.56,0:00:57.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}and learn to persevere when facing a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.45,0:01:04.42,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}For schools, the platform brings together\Nthe club's organisation,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.44,0:01:06.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}the course materials and the exercises.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.52,0:01:09.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}The teacher presents the session,\Nopens the activities
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.53,0:01:14.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}and sees attendance, progress\Nand results for every student.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.35,0:01:18.86,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}From first attempts to coding challenges,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.88,0:01:21.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}every session invites students\Nto understand code
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.62,0:01:23.42,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}and to bring their ideas to life.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.35,0:01:25.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Discover L9ITHA.Club.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.54,0:01:29.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}To join the club or request\Na demo, get in touch.
